### 2.2 Cross-Chain Governance Flow

```
1. Governor (Cardano)  → Proposal created, quadratic voting (√stake)
2. Proposal passes     → Timelock UTXO created with 48h delay
3. Delay elapses       → Intent released for ICB relay
4. ICB Relay           → Mithril proof + intent forwarded to Polygon
5. GovernorExecutor    → Verifies Mithril proof, applies action on Polygon
```

This "Command and Verify" loop ensures Cardano's eUTXO governance controls Polygon's EVM execution, combining mathematical rigor with high-throughput settlement.

