## 7. Security Architecture

### 7.1 Eight-Layer Defense in Depth

```
Layer 1: PERIMETER     │ DDoS protection + Rate limiting
Layer 2: AUTHENTICATION│ EIP-4361 SIWE + Agent DID
Layer 3: AUTHORIZATION │ RBAC + Capability-based + Polygon ID
Layer 4: TRANSPORT     │ TLS 1.3 + Message signing + Replay protection
Layer 5: EXECUTION     │ TEE isolation + WASM sandboxing
Layer 6: ECONOMIC      │ Staking + Slashing + Insurance fund
Layer 7: AUTOMATED     │ VAMSSentinel (autonomous on-chain guardian)
Layer 8: RECOVERY      │ Circuit breakers + Emergency governance + L1 fallbacks
```

### 7.2 Cardano-Specific Failure Handling

| Scenario | Response |
|----------|----------|
| **Cardano L1 halt** | Fallback to Ethereum L1 mainnet for high-value settlement |
| **Hydra channel failure** | Graceful close with dispute period, settle on Cardano L1 |
| **Mithril proof unavailability** | Queue intents, extended settlement timeouts |
| **Midnight unavailability** | Delay compliance-required operations, queue ZK proofs |

